Package: hinglishpy
Version: 3.5.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: termux-learn-crypto <vilasrmeshram400@gmail.com>
Depends: python
Section: python
Priority: optional
Description: HinglishPy - Python jaisa, par Hinglish me
 Apna compiler: Hinglish source (.hl) compile karke Python me badalta hai.
 Keywords: agar, nahito, warna, jabtak, har, kaam, varg, koshish, pakdo,
 ant, wapas, lao, se, jaise, chhodo, todo, jaari, sach, mitao, batao,
 asink, intezar, baishvik, asthaniye, bolo, puchho, khud.
 f-strings ke andar bhi Hinglish expressions support karta hai.
 Run: .hl file compile + run (hinglishpy file.hl run), ya interactive REPL.
